WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.288 --> 00:00:19.137
"We can't let Zork's team win," Ben told his teammates.

2
00:00:20.098 --> 00:00:26.201
"We'll do better in the next two events—the slime ball toss and the cross-country race," Deb said.

3
00:00:26.221 --> 00:00:30.083
"I'm a good runner, even without kangaroo feet."

4
00:00:30.103 --> 00:00:32.616
"Me too," Mog said.

5
00:00:32.636 --> 00:00:34.717
"I think I can outrun Zork."

6
00:00:34.737 --> 00:00:38.179
"You were beating him in the sack race," Ben said.

7
00:00:38.639 --> 00:00:40.340
He suddenly remembered something.

8
00:00:44.501 --> 00:00:46.702
did you whisper to Zork just before the race started?

9
00:00:47.162 --> 00:00:48.763
It seemed to spook him."

10
00:00:48.783 --> 00:00:49.683
Mog laughed.

11
00:00:49.703 --> 00:00:51.844
"I wanted to rattle him.

12
00:00:52.565 --> 00:00:55.866
So I said, 'Don't trip over your own tail.'"

13
00:00:55.886 --> 00:00:59.527
"And he did trip over his tail!"

14
00:01:00.028 --> 00:01:00.688
Jen said.

15
00:01:03.088 --> 00:01:06.089
"Too bad we didn't win though," Mog said ruefully.

16
00:01:08.090 --> 00:01:10.230
Soon everybody was back on the field.

17
00:01:10.950 --> 00:01:14.591
The two teams stood opposite each other a short distance apart.

18
00:01:18.832 --> 00:01:23.894
slime ball toss ends when all three players on one team are out," Mr.

19
00:01:23.954 --> 00:01:24.894
Gwarg explained.

20
00:01:24.914 --> 00:01:32.076
"Remember, you have to throw the slime balls to the opposing player and not at the opposing player.

21
00:01:32.968 --> 00:01:35.129
And you must throw underhand.

22
00:01:35.929 --> 00:01:40.370
After two tosses, you will step back and start tossing again.

23
00:01:40.850 --> 00:01:41.571
Good luck!"

24
00:01:42.931 --> 00:01:45.232
The first few tosses went smoothly.

25
00:01:49.193 --> 00:01:51.833
Then Pixel missed a toss from Cleo.

26
00:01:52.314 --> 00:01:56.335
The slime ball fell between his hands and crashed onto the ground.

27
00:01:56.795 --> 00:02:00.416
Splat! "You're out, Pixel," Cleo said.

28
00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:05.801
Lon went out next, after a toss from Ben.

29
00:02:05.821 --> 00:02:10.762
"Ick!" the werewolf said as the slime ball exploded on his snout.

30
00:02:11.983 --> 00:02:16.284
Jen took out Gaby as Ben got a new slime ball and faced Cleo.

31
00:02:17.224 --> 00:02:21.286
Meanwhile Mog and Zork were trying hard to knock each other out.

32
00:02:22.086 --> 00:02:25.767
They threw their ball underhand, but their tosses were very high.

33
00:02:26.307 --> 00:02:29.228
And as they played, they argued back and forth.

34
00:02:29.728 --> 00:02:32.490
"I'll get you back for that crack about my tail!"

35
00:02:32.810 --> 00:02:33.491
Zork said.

36
00:02:33.511 --> 00:02:37.874
"Only if you don't trip over it!"

37
00:02:38.194 --> 00:02:39.154
Mog shot back.

38
00:02:40.215 --> 00:02:42.297
Deb and Carly were tossing to each other.

39
00:02:43.457 --> 00:02:48.200
Both doppelgangers had grown giant-size hands that looked like baseball gloves.

40
00:02:50.102 --> 00:02:55.305
Ben tossed the slime ball to Cleo, and then they each took several steps backward again.

41
00:02:55.325 --> 00:02:58.087
"Argh! I'm out!"

42
00:02:58.507 --> 00:02:59.168
Mog cried.

43
00:02:59.764 --> 00:03:04.646
The slime ball was caught on one of his horns, and the slime was dripping into his eyes.

44
00:03:04.666 --> 00:03:09.788
"Yes!" Zork dropped to his knees and threw his arms in the air.

45
00:03:10.329 --> 00:03:12.830
Brunhilda had been catching Waldo's tosses.

46
00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:19.213
"Ahh!" She suddenly missed a slime ball, and now her whole face was covered in the gooey stuff.

47
00:03:19.233 --> 00:03:24.715
"I guess Waldo is good at this," Ben thought, watching.

48
00:03:24.735 --> 00:03:26.616
"He has—" Splat!

49
00:03:27.292 --> 00:03:29.613
A slime ball slammed Ben in the forehead.

50
00:03:30.494 --> 00:03:36.516
With Ben out, Cleo went to face Waldo, just as Deb missed a low throw and got her

51
00:03:36.656 --> 00:03:37.657
legs splattered.

52
00:03:40.438 --> 00:03:44.880
That left Carly waiting for an opponent, but only for a moment.

53
00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:49.842
Splat! Zork stared down at a big slime stain on his belly.

54
00:03:49.862 --> 00:03:54.024
"It's all in the wrist action," Jen boasted.

55
00:03:54.928 --> 00:03:58.590
She picked up a new slime ball and began tossing with Carly.

56
00:03:58.610 --> 00:04:04.912
"Only Waldo and Jen are left from Team Black," Ben thought.

57
00:04:04.932 --> 00:04:07.534
"Can they beat Cleo and Carly?"

58
00:04:08.474 --> 00:04:12.936
For several tosses, no one missed, so no one got slimed.

59
00:04:12.956 --> 00:04:15.417
"C'mon, Team Black!

60
00:04:15.657 --> 00:04:16.637
You can do it!"

61
00:04:16.977 --> 00:04:17.698
Mog yelled.

62
00:04:17.718 --> 00:04:19.679
"Beat 'em, Team Orange!"

63
00:04:20.099 --> 00:04:21.159
Zork shouted back.

64
00:04:22.764 --> 00:04:25.445
"Ahh!" Waldo suddenly scratched his arms and his belly.

65
00:04:25.465 --> 00:04:27.166
"I'm so itchy!

66
00:04:27.927 --> 00:04:29.328
It must be the grass from the field."

67
00:04:30.608 --> 00:04:35.651
Cleo tossed the slime ball, which bounced off Waldo's arm and into the grass.

68
00:04:35.671 --> 00:04:38.793
"Yes!" Cleo cheered.

69
00:04:39.813 --> 00:04:42.074
Then Carly let out a startled cry.

70
00:04:42.094 --> 00:04:43.255
"Oh no!"

71
00:04:43.615 --> 00:04:47.357
Her slime ball slid from her hand and smashed her right in the mouth.

72
00:04:48.838 --> 00:04:49.879
She licked her lips.

73
00:04:49.899 --> 00:04:52.200
"It tastes good though!"

74
00:04:53.516 --> 00:04:57.118
"We've got our finalists—Cleo and Jen!"

75
00:04:57.518 --> 00:04:58.778
Mr. Gwarg announced.

76
00:04:59.359 --> 00:05:04.781
He handed a new ball to Cleo, and a hush fell over the crowd as the two monsters

77
00:05:04.861 --> 00:05:06.962
began tossing the ball back and forth.

78
00:05:07.722 --> 00:05:09.103
Ben bit a fingernail.

79
00:05:10.183 --> 00:05:13.024
Next to him, Deb looked just as nervous.

80
00:05:13.044 --> 00:05:18.187
"If Jen loses," Deb whispered, "Team Orange will win Field Day."

81
00:05:18.207 --> 00:05:21.108
"I know," Ben said grimly.

82
00:05:21.908 --> 00:05:23.609
Cleo tossed the ball again.

83
00:05:24.149 --> 00:05:26.290
This time it soared high into the air.

84
00:05:27.030 --> 00:05:31.072
Jen reached for it, but her arms were short, and Boink!

85
00:05:31.712 --> 00:05:34.833
As the ball hit her head, the crowd gasped.

86
00:05:36.454 --> 00:05:38.155
But the slime ball didn't break.

87
00:05:38.695 --> 00:05:42.356
Instead it sank back down and right into her waiting hands.

88
00:05:45.118 --> 00:05:46.058
Ben laughed.

89
00:05:47.819 --> 00:05:50.920
"No wonder she's doing so well in this event.

90
00:05:51.276 --> 00:05:52.137
Blobs are soft!"

91
00:05:53.358 --> 00:05:54.599
Jen threw the ball back.

92
00:05:55.319 --> 00:05:58.522
Cleo caught it, but then it slipped from her fingers.

93
00:05:59.723 --> 00:06:02.525
Splat! Slime splashed everywhere.

94
00:06:03.626 --> 00:06:05.688
Mog and Ben bumped chests.

95
00:06:06.088 --> 00:06:08.370
Team Black's fans were going wild.

96
00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:12.994
"Team Black has won the slime ball toss!"

97
00:06:13.594 --> 00:06:14.815
Mr. Gwarg called out.

98
00:06:15.696 --> 00:06:17.297
Jen grinned proudly.

99
00:06:17.317 --> 00:06:20.500
"It's great to be a blob!"
